Description: Write st3d sample-entry metadata from multiview caps
 Keep existing svmi metadata and write the standard st3d modes where they
 represent the caps, without inventing a layout for unsupported transforms.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-23

